    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a good start, super sweet tone. But it feels a bit \"safe,\" you know? It's very soft. Can you make it a bit more impactful? Like, more clearly explain why these traditional setups are actually better for kids compared to all the different, less stable arrangements you see nowadays? I want to make sure the point really lands.",
